  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2205.02 Record Check Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2205.02 Record Check Fee. In addition to any other fees required by statute, all applicants for a private investigator, security guard license or bail recovery agent shall pay a fee as set forth in Saf-C 5703.06, at the time of application to cover the expenses of a state criminal record check.\n\nSource. #7761, eff 9-21-02; ss by #9484 eff 6-19-09 (from Saf-C 2205.01); ss by #12513, eff 4-12-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2200.html"
